WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.549
The timing could not be better for a method that
gets this right.

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:09.178
Every day the world's sensors, wearables,

00:00:09.258 --> 00:00:13.807
and industrial systems pour out staggering volumes
of unlabeled time series through the Internet of Things.

00:00:13.887 --> 00:00:18.436
That data is a gold mine, but only if we can learn
from it without hand labeling.

00:00:18.516 --> 00:00:23.064
The key insight motivating TimeSiam is that time
series carry a special kind of information

00:00:23.144 --> 00:00:27.693
prior methods throw away: the correlation between
what happened in the past and what is

00:00:27.773 --> 00:00:32.322
happening now.

00:00:32.402 --> 00:00:36.951
Instead of treating each window in isolation,

00:00:37.031 --> 00:00:41.580
why not build a pre-training task that explicitly
asks the model to relate distant moments in time to each other.
